  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) VINDICTIVE ARTILLERISTS (Madcap Meks) through the real unit_selected_to_shoot WINDOW. Setup-only: P1's detachment is switched to Madcap Meks (fixture army is War Horde), Custodian Guard C is moved unengaged in front of the Ork rank with inflated wounds, and the defender auto-allocates. A real click on the Mek Gunz token opens the StratagemDialog with the VINDICTIVE ARTILLERISTS card showing ONLY the three option buttons ([LETHAL HITS] / [SUSTAINED HITS 1] / [HAZARDOUS]+[LETHAL HITS]+[SUSTAINED HITS 1]), all enabled; there is no plain Use button. A real click on the overcharged option spends 1 CP and gives the Mek Gunz ranged LETHAL HITS, SUSTAINED HITS 1 and HAZARDOUS for the phase. The shot is declared and resolved through Quick-Assign, Confirm, the dock's Fast button and the save overlay's Done: the hit roll carries LETHAL + SUSTAINED HITS 1 and a hazard roll follows the attacks.",
